{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/159dfb225fc4beb798987b15c1bcf348.avif?t=1759501553\" width=400 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/750756775a1589eb4fdc09aaadf65398.poster.avif?t=1759501553\" width=538 height=538 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/750756775a1589eb4fdc09aaadf65398.webm?t=1759501553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/750756775a1589eb4fdc09aaadf65398.mp4?t=1759501553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everybody starts somewhere, and for you (a street urchin with no resources), that means carrying crates and barrels to pay your rent. Your pay will scale with the difficulty of the job, and you will eventually find gear to help you do this more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/3a3a58d9821086bd1dd328929993f9c0.avif?t=1759501553\" width=400 height=61 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/eec6c39f0373b314e74f00eeb72c209e.poster.avif?t=1759501553\" width=500 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/eec6c39f0373b314e74f00eeb72c209e.webm?t=1759501553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/eec6c39f0373b314e74f00eeb72c209e.mp4?t=1759501553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The market opening each day is an opportunity for you to make money, whether that's as a shop assistant at first or later as a business owner with your own stalls. Influence which stalls succeed and fail based on where you deliver your goods as a dock worker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/23a3fc5928496d71eae195a51bbbfcd5.avif?t=1759501553\" width=400 height=61 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/79b14a9781af59c392436b78ab7a7f23.poster.avif?t=1759501553\" width=538 height=460 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/79b14a9781af59c392436b78ab7a7f23.webm?t=1759501553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/extras/79b14a9781af59c392436b78ab7a7f23.mp4?t=1759501553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During your time off (in the evening and on free days), you can choose how to spend your time. Whether that's improving your fishing skill, or diving for clams and treasure, or figuring out the mystery of your past.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2014160?t=1759501553","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2014160?t=1759501553","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/296f77cf2f1bd468c26dba525d2dc80f41cfed7e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759501553","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014160/296f77cf2f